 the system interface for starting an"},{"text":"activity, and optionally starts a FaceTime call for that activity."},{"text":""},{"text":"A ``GroupActivitySharingController`` helps you start a SharePlay activity,"},{"text":"even when a FaceTime call isn't currently active. When presented,"},{"text":"the view controller prompts the person to start the activity you provided."},{"text":"If no FaceTime call is active, the view controller also displays a people"},{"text":"picker to let the person select the participants for the activity. When"},{"text":"they choose to start the activity, the view controller automatically starts the"},{"text":"FaceTime call as needed and joins your app to the activity."},{"text":""},{"text":"If your app’s interface includes controls to start SharePlay activities,"},{"text":"present this view controller in response to interactions with those controls."},{"text":"Initialize the ``GroupActivitySharingController`` object with the activity"},{"text":"you want to start. After you present it, the view controller handles all"},{"text":"further interactions. It manages the interface that appears onscreen and"},{"text":"responds when someone chooses to start or cancel the activity. It starts"},{"text":"the FaceTime call if one isn’t currently active. It also dismisses itself"},{"text":"and returns control back to your app, updating its ``result`` property"},{"text":"to let you know what happened."}]},"declarationFragments":[{"kind":"attribute","spelling":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","spelling":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","spelling":" "},{"kind":"attribute","spelling":"@objc"},{"kind":"text","spelling":" "},{"kind":"keyword","spelling":"class"},{"kind":"text","spelling":" "},{"kind":"identifier","spelling":"GroupActivitySharingController"}],"accessLevel":"public","availability":[{"domain":"watchOS","isUnconditionallyUnavailable":true},{"domain":"macCatalyst","introduced":{"major":15,"minor":4}},{"domain":"iOS","introduced":{